WEBVTT

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.580
We've really been through a lot, huh?

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.380
So many, many things...

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.880
You had your fair share of pathetic moments
at the start, often being the butt of people's jokes.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:29.330
Even after you grew a little stronger, someone tougher
was always standing in your way.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.580
It was a constant ordeal.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.380
Hardly a day went by when you weren't injured.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.460
There were some rough times.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:39.880
Moments I thought you might break down.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:44.290
Moments I feared you would be swallowed by despair.

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:46.920
Moments it looked like you were down for the count.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:52.080
But you never stopped wishing for it.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.830
Wishing to be a hero.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.290
Wishing to be stronger.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.330
You kept saying it over and over.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:05.210
Striving to reach your goal. To keep on fighting.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.460
To uphold your promises.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.790
You surmounted countless adversities...

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.210
and now just look at how far you've come.

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:38.290
Congratulations, Bell.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:40.330
You've ranked up.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:54.130
So, Bell. Was that black minotaur a tough opponent?

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.080
Very.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:03.580
He fought through the Battle of Knossos
and protected the Xenos.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:09.290
Generally speaking, that feat alone could
have made him worthy enough for a rank up.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:11.790
But that wasn't all.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:14.580
It was his defeat that was the most meaningful.

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:20.250
The frustration that he felt... is actually what
pushed Bell's status to the next stage.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:27.540
Vesta...

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:28.750
Huh?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:34.210
Oh, nothing! Seeing you in this moment
just made me feel like saying that.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:41.670
It's a symbol of all the things I preside over,
while also being a title, and another name that I go by.

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:44.960
And that's... "Vesta"?

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:46.130
Yep.

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:49.170
It has the meaning of "perpetual flame".

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.040
Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:58.420
Prelude

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:58.420
Night Before Departure

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:00.210
I take it your injuries have all healed cleanly, Bell Cranel.

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:03.000
They have. Thanks for your help.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:05.960
I hear that you have reached level 4.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.000
And I see the expression on your face
has changed a great deal.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.330
You think so?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.170
Indeed.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.210
Although, that's coming from someone who has no eyes.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:19.380
Tell me. Have you decided what
your next course of action will be?

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:23.460
Yes. I'm going to start exploring the dungeon again.

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:26.580
To become even stronger.

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:29.920
It sounds like you're committed to that.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.540
However...

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.630
I detect a slight hesitance under the surface.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:39.250
Coexistence between humanity and
the Xenos is impossible until

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:42.290
the deepest level of the dungeon has been conquered.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.880
It doesn't matter how much Ouranos and I strive to help,

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:50.790
because the future that we wish for will never come
as long as that feat remains unaccomplished.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.540
If you want to act with the Xenos' best interests at heart,

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.460
then please push onwards, Bell Cranel.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:02.040
What exactly is down there...
on the deepest floor of the dungeon?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.330
A covenant that was forged.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.500
And... a conclusion.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.960
On that note, Miss Eina.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:16.460
I, Luvis, shall now gallantly venture forth to
the lower floors of the dungeon and resolve a quest.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:21.000
Shove off! You're interrupting
our precious personal time before I leave for the day!

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:25.790
Eina, my dear! I'll be sure to bring you a wonderful
present from the lower floors after I complete my quest!

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:30.330
Quit grandstanding, you dwarf bumpkin!
Nobody cares about your pathetic quest!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:34.540
Stuff it, you weak ass elf! The only one here taking
on leftover quests for losers is you!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.580
Um, Mr. Luvis and Mr. Dormul...?

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:41.130
Quests on the lower floors can be
especially dangerous for adventurers.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.210
So I wish you a safe journey.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.880
Thank you, Eina my dear!

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.250
Dude. She was clearly talking to me.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.040
Say that again, I'll break you like a stick!

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:51.210
Just try it, jughead!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.250
Welcome in, Bell!
Just try it, jughead!

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:52.460
Welcome in, Bell!

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.670
Huh? Aren't you...

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:57.670
The Little Rookie?

00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:02.040
Pardon me. I'm happy to wait for a moment
if you're in the middle of something.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.250
It's okay! I'm the one who asked you to come!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.830
Here. It's for you.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.250
No way, is that what I think it is?!

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.250
Sh-sh-she's giving him a love letter?!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.130
Miss Eina, isn't this a...?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.670
Yep. But it's an official one this time.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.380
A directive for the Hestia Familia from the Guild.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:30.080
Jeez, another mission?

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.380
We just got done handling the Xenos stuff

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:37.000
and here they come dumping another
compulsory mission on our heads!

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.960
What do you expect? That was all done under the table.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:46.460
On the bright side, this means that our Familia has gotten
strong enough to be considered for missions.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.960
Although, it's mainly thanks to Master Bell's power.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:54.710
Aw phooey! I wouldn't have registered as an exploration
Familia if I knew they'd saddle us with this crap.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.380
I figured it was the best choice,

00:05:56.380 --> 00:06:00.710
since the application process was easy and people
said we'd get all sorts of preferential treatment.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.580
That was the reason you picked it?!

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:08.130
Don't give me a hard time! Nobody could have
imagined that we would get so strong, so fast!

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.880
But this works out perfectly. Right, Bell?

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:11.880
Yeah!

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:15.250
My plan was to go back down into
the dungeon once everybody was ready.

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:18.790
And I've already whipped up
new equipment for the whole team.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:22.290
The Guild didn't even have to bother. We're raring to go!

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.880
The mission itself is about what you'd expect.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:30.500
We have to break our previous floor record, and
then return with a number of items they've requested.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.460
Basically, we have to go on an expedition. Period.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.830
But that leaves us with some options.

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:38.790
Either we simply accomplish the goals they've given us.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.330
Or do more.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.080
I want... to press further on!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.540
For Wiene and the Xenos!

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.250
And for our own benefit!

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:49.960
I want all of us to get stronger!

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.170
That settles that.

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:53.330
Great!

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:58.040
Then we might as well reach out to Take and Miach
and have them provide us some back up!

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.000
We'll form a united front!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.750
A united front? Really?

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.580
This isn't just a mission!
It's an expedition to bolster our strength!

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.420
Which means the more allies, the better!

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.580
We're all going to press further on together, right?

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.630
Let's make it happen, you guys!

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:16.000
Okay!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.330
I see. An expedition, eh?

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.420
Yes.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.920
And as a member of the Hestia Familia...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.750
I am here to humbly request that you join us!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:32.290
Despite the clear risks involved, I have no objections
to offering Hestia my assistance.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.000
What do you two think?

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.000
I feel exactly the same.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.000
We owe them a debt that we haven't fully paid back yet.

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:42.460
Same here. I would very much like
to accompany Ouka and Mikoto.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.460
In which case, it's best to be fully prepared.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.250
It's been a while since we last sparred.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:50.920
Care to go a round?

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:52.960
Gladly!

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:58.210
All right, so the members of the Miach Familia
who can join us on the expedition are...

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.880
Cassandra and myself.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:04.580
And our captain said she's going to provide
logistical support, like securing items and such.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.710
How should we fit you into the party formation?

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:14.830
Back when I was in the Apollo Familia,
I served as an odd-jobber in the middle guard.

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.540
And Cassandra would fit best in the rearguard.

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:21.540
Since she's a healer, you can bet
she's going to be way more useful than I am.

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:24.580
G-gosh, that's so kind of you to say, Daphne...

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:26.580
What are you getting all blushy about?

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.750
Is that a list of who's going to be in the party?

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:35.790
Yes. In addition to our usual members, we have Master
Ouka and Lady Chigusa from Master Takemikazuchi's.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:36.920
And also...

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:38.710
Lady Aisha.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.250
Wait, Aisha?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:44.630
You mean Aisha Belka?!
The former member of the Ishtar Familia?!

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:46.080
Antianeira...

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.080
Yep.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:52.040
I don't know how she found out,
but she suddenly came marching up to our home and...

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.040
So, I hear you're going on an expedition.

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:57.500
You better take me with you.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:03.790
We had no good reason to refuse
and happily added her to our roster, but then...

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:06.920
with a battle formation that includes two level 4s,

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:11.420
the discussion shifted to how easily we could
push through the middle floors and go deeper...

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:13.290
Yeah, that figures.

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:16.000
It would be a waste of effort to form this
big of a party just to complete a mission.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:16.790
Right.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:21.130
And of course, the plan was always to
adventure as far as we could possibly go.

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:24.420
That makes things difficult for you.

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:29.040
A level 1 supporter will undoubtedly be
the first one to die once we hit the lower levels.

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:31.540
D-Daphne!

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.040
What's the problem?

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.380
I'm just telling the truth.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.670
But, if you insist on coming along no matter what,

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:39.290
then we'll have to find a compromise.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.460
You won't fight,

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:46.710
and instead issue orders that guide the battle
while staying put in the rearguard.

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:48.710
Basically, a strategist.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:52.920
I'm not fond of the role because
I was forced into it a few times,

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.540
but having someone in the back who
keeps track of the bigger picture

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.000
is really important.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.580
Keep track... of the bigger picture?

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:02.790
Yep!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.750
It's exactly what Finn Deimne of the Loki Familia does.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.080
Except...

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:10.080
everybody knows that he's also ridiculously strong.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:15.290
During the War Games, I was honestly frustrated
when you totally outwitted us.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.750
I think you've got the talent for it.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:21.750
And if you're willing to try, I'll teach you
all the basics that you need to know.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:24.580
Yes, please!

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:32.330
Foolish!

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:35.880
Mikoto!

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:42.630
Some people say the majority of adventurers
are too preoccupied with their status.

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.710
I tend to agree with that.

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.790
Even someone with a normal physique like me

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.460
can compete with you on an equal level
just by mastering martial arts.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.330
It all comes down to techniques and tactics.

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:57.210
Your status isn't something that improves in a single day.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:58.540
However...

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.710
...techniques and tactics are.

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:06.880
That being said, you shouldn't expect
to master techniques with ease, either.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:11.830
You will need energy, effort, and a strong conviction
to see things through to the end.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.790
Only then do you stand a chance of pulling it off.

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:17.460
A strong... conviction...

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:23.210
What I desire... is a technique
that can oppose the powerful.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.580
Strength that can save my friends and help us survive
our adventures!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.960
Then learn exactly that. Mikoto, Chigusa.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:36.630
By unleashing your techniques with proper timing and
proper breath control,

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:38.960
you can hurl even the heaviest of giants.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:41.380
And slice though even the hardest of bodies.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:43.670
You have both grown beyond

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:45.540
who you were back in the Far East.

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:51.040
I shall grant your wish. And give you a lesson
on what I could never teach you back then.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:53.960
Come!

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.080
What can I do for you, Big Guy?

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.080
Mikoto told us about your expedition.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.830
Chigusa and I will be joining you.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.580
You came just to tell me that?

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:17.880
No.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.250
This will be an expedition
into unexplored territory for us as well...

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:24.750
I want to do everything I can to be prepared.

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:28.250
So what, you want me to coach you?

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.380
It won't do much good.

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:31.960
I know that.

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.130
I'm a blacksmith.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:38.960
And right now I'm helping my friends by making sure
they're armed with the highest-quality equipment.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.000
I'm already doing everything I can.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:43.250
So I don't have time to waste wi-

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:44.290
I need a weapon!

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:48.420
I would like you to make me one.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:49.830
Please.

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:56.750
I want the real deal. A weapon that I can reliably
use to keep Chigusa and Haruhime safe.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.460
My custom-made stuff doesn't come cheap.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.130
Give me a discount

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:08.880
Like hell I will!

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:16.290
E-excuse me, Miss Aisha...?

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:21.830
M-may I ask what exactly you intend to do?

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:25.250
I mean, why did you close everything up?

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:28.790
That should be obvious, Haruhime.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.790
I'm going to put you through a special drill.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.540
Special... thrill...

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.880
Huh?! Special drill?!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:45.580
Yeah. You're the biggest pushover out of everybody
that's going on the expedition.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.380
You know that, right?

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:55.380
If all you can do is provide a single level-boost,
then you're honestly going to be a burden.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:14:00.630
That may be true, but I don't have the ability to
fight like Mikoto and the others.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:04.130
And nobody is expecting a Sorcerer
like you to start throwing punches.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.080
Casting magic is your strong suit.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:08.460
Okay, so you're saying I should refine my magic?

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:09.790
Nope.

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:12.380
You're going to learn new magic.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:18.250
B-but how? Learning new magic is a complicated
and time-consuming process.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.920
That's why we're gonna take the easy route.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.670
And force it out.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:25.330
What is that?

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.580
A grimoire.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.630
The Great Falls...

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:39.130
The name of a huge waterfall that's located on the 25th
floor, which is considered the first of the lower floors.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:43.080
It continues down through multiple floors
and ends on the 27th.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:46.750
You sure are amazing, Bell.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:47.460
Huh?

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:52.540
Most people I know prepare to explore new floors
by brushing up on battle strategies and such.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:57.750
But here you are spending time gathering
information, like it's no big deal.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:01.250
It's almost as if you're a first-class adventurer.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:09.080
I realized something. The true meaning behind all
the lessons that you've given me, Miss Eina.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:14.080
Knowledge is vital, because it can be what keeps
your party safe on a new floor.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:17.960
That's why I'm here, to do everything
I possibly can to be prepared.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.080
Oh, Bell...

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:25.290
Only a few months have passed
since we first met each other.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.710
But he's really grown up.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.830
His admiration for Lady Wallenstein
has gradually led him to new heights.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:36.290
Now he can even fight against
powerful monsters like that minotaur.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.580
I don't have it in me to ask any of the details.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.170
But it's crazy how much boys like him change.

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:47.000
And in such a short time...

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:48.540
Miss Eina?

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.040
Huh? Y-yes? What is it?

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:54.210
I'm curious about the monsters that appear
in this area near the Great Falls...

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:00.080
Well, the one that you most need to watch out
for is a flying monster called Iguazu.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:03.670
It's recommended that you flee at all costs,
even if that means ditching your belongings.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:04.170
Because it's a monster that can move extremely fast.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:05.460
This is bad.
Because it's a monster that can move extremely fast.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.000
Because it's a monster that can move extremely fast.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:06.830
It's so quick that adventurers haven taken to calling it
"the invisible monster" or "the flash".

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:10.000
I think... I may be head over heels.
It's so quick that adventurers haven taken to calling it
"the invisible monster" or "the flash".

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:10.500
It's so quick that adventurers haven taken to calling it
"the invisible monster" or "the flash".

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:13.790
Hear me out.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:15.830
I'm not sure how to describe it,

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:20.460
but I've got a feeling that some sort of
bittersweet aura is encroaching on Bell right now.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:22.420
Or is my imagination just running wild?

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:23.710
It's definitely that.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.920
Indeed. Forget it and drink up.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:30.920
Let me thank you again for agreeing
to work with us on the expedition, Take.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:32.210
Miach.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:33.420
Hephaistos.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:36.040
Don't mention it, Hestia.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.880
Anything to help out a good friend.

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:43.330
Yes. Besides, we'll be asking you
for help in return eventually.

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.080
It's give and take.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:50.420
As you requested, I'm sending some of my blacksmiths
to watch over your home in the meantime.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.500
All I had to do was mention
they could see Welf's workshop in person

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:56.540
and I was up to my neck in volunteers!

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:01.380
Thank you! I'd be stuck at home and couldn't
go to work without someone else around.

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.420
No kidding. But asking me to provide house-sitters so

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:07.210
that you can come work to repay your debt
doesn't really balance out, you know!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.500
But I must say,

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:17.040
watching us sit here and knock back drinks
while leaving all of the preparation to the children...

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.630
is a little embarrassing.

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:23.000
What else am I supposed to do?!
They're always on top of everything!

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:26.210
I'm literally the only one left with nothing to do!

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:31.330
I can relate. I learned today that Ouka, Chigusa,
and Mikoto have grown much stronger.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.630
They left me with the bruises to prove it.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.500
Naza has also made great strides in
improving her pharmaceutical mixing skills.

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:42.000
She seemed very keen on developing
a new potion before the expedition for Bell's sake.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.960
I guess all kids really do grow up...

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.830
And they need less and less of my help.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.710
Why the long face, Hestia?
Let me guess, you're feeling lonely?

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:56.330
Obviously! I can't go into
the dungeon with them, after all!

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.420
Who wouldn't be lonely...?

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:03.250
Sure, but you must be equally as proud of them, right?

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:06.170
Yes! You're totally right, Hephaistos!

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:09.750
I'm not sure whether to call it happiness or pride.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:12.380
But it makes my heart feel all warm and fuzzy!

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:18.920
Bell used to be such a crybaby and now he's turned into
this super cool, super brave, and dignified young man!

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.380
Gosh, I'm falling for him all over again!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.250
My heart is aflutter!

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:30.250
Bell is mine! And I refuse to let anyone else have him!

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:34.500
I love you Bell!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:41.460
To be honest, I'm not without
my concerns about the expedition.

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:45.540
After all, Bell and the others are
doing it to bolster their strength.

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:49.080
This is hard to say after we invited
your children to join us, but...

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:51.130
it's going to be risky.

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:54.880
Even so, I have faith!

00:18:55.250 --> 00:19:00.080
Bell can do it. I know my Familia
has what it takes to rise to the challenge.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:03.080
Indeed. They have to.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:04.210
Yes.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:05.960
I am certain they will.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:07.960
They're going to be just fine.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:13.290
Well then, here's to a successful
adventure for our children!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:14.670
Cheers!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.750
Master Welf is asking if we can wait just a little longer!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:42.290
Ugh, seriously? I told him to be here on the dot.

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:45.170
What about Lady Daphne and Lady Cassandra?

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:50.000
Sorry. They were busy arguing about something
this morning, so we left before them.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.580
I think they should be here soon.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.380
I hope you're right...

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:58.580
What a mess. The fact we're having trouble before
the expedition even begins doesn't inspire confidence.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.880
I honestly thought I would be the last one here.
I rushed all this way for nothing.

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.330
My apologies...

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:06.080
Sorry we're late!

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.000
I'm sorry!

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.130
Did something happen?

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.130
You're not gonna believe it!

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:16.130
The big day finally comes and Cassandra suddenly
tells me that she doesn't want to go anymore!

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.330
W-well, it's because I had another dream.

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:23.630
This disgusting, green moss was trying
to swallow up a ton of people!

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:25.920
S-so please consider it.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:30.380
Can we cancel or, perhaps, postpone the expedition?

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.790
Uh... no can do. I'm sorry.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.040
I figured...

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:44.630
Oh please, everybody knows we're bound to run
into trouble after passing through the middle floors.

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:47.250
But overcoming that challenge
is what an adventure is all about.

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.080
Right...

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:50.040
Sorry, guys.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:51.460
I'm all ready now.

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:00.960
Is this it? The weapon I ordered?

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:02.210
Yep.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:05.540
You better earn enough on this expedition to pay it off.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.290
This is a masterpiece.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:12.130
Heh. You're damn straight.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.330
Bell. This one's for you.

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.000
It's a new weapon that I made from unicorn horn.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.210
I call it the Hakugen.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.170
"Hakugen"...

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:25.380
It's so light!

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:29.130
I was working on it until the very last minute,
but I'm confident it's one of my best.

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:31.080
Put it to good use, eh?

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:33.420
Thank you, Welf!

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.710
Okay, everyone. It's time to go!

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.750
We'll handle things here, so go give 'em hell.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.580
Be careful out there.

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.170
And don't do anything crazy.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.460
Remember, Bell.

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:53.460
Always keep your guard up!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:54.920
Will do.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:57.880
Give it all you got.

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:58.920
Right!

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:01.710
Goodbye for now!

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:09.920
Please watch out!

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:17.380
More enemies incoming from 2 o'clock!

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:21.500
Hey, Big Guy!

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:36.540
Damn! They just keep coming!

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:37.460
Here I go!

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:44.920
Master Bell! Over there!

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:46.170
Take out that nest!

00:22:55.830 --> 00:22:57.830
Fire Bolt!

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:10.920
Holy crap.

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:15.250
So this is... level 4.

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:42.080
Next Time

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:42.080
The Great Falls

00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:42.080
The Great Falls

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:41.130
Next time, "The Great Falls".
